config UNISOC_QOGIRN5_BACKLIGHT
 bool "U30 Pro PWM backlight (sprd,qogirn5-backlight)"
 depends on PWM && BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
 help
  Registers the board's PWM backlight as /sys/class/backlight/sprd_backlight
  with the stock 0..4095 brightness scale.
config UNISOC_NV3002C_PANEL
 bool "U30 Pro NV3002C 240x240 SPI panel (DRM)"
 depends on DRM && SPI && OF && GPIOLIB
 select DRM_KMS_HELPER
 select DRM_GEM_DMA_HELPER
 select DRM_MIPI_DBI
 select DRM_FBDEV_DMA_HELPER if DRM_FBDEV_EMULATION
 help
  DRM driver for the SPI display of the ZTE U30 Pro, written on top of the
  mipi-dbi helpers.  The panel description (init sequence, reset timing) is
  taken from the unmodified stock device tree (/lcds/<spi_panel_name>).
config UNISOC_TLSC_TOUCH
 bool "U30 Pro touch controller (tlsc6x / CHSC6448)"
 depends on I2C && INPUT && OF
 help
  Run-time touch reporting for the I2C touch panel (name tlsc6x_touch, 0..239 range).
